# G0.4/V10-8 decision criteria (order V2 §8/§15.5, plan "GELTENDE REGELN" no. 5).
# PROPOSED by Claude on 2026-10-27, before any evaluation of the campaign started the same day
# (~/.darkbot/g04/campaign_20261027). They become binding only after the user's one explicit
# confirmation: then BSC_G04_CRITERIA_STATE=CONFIRMED and this file's SHA-256 in STATUS.md (row P),
# never changed after results are known. Until then the census reports CRITERIA_UNCONFIRMED.
#
# Scope: chain 56; foreign launches of Flap (Portal), Four Classic (TokenManager2) and OpenFour (Core)
# as the canonical follower joins them; sources FREE_ONLY (public WSS PublicNode + dRPC); native geth,
# 48Club and BlockReq are not part of this campaign (a limit, not a result).
# Denominator per venue: canonical, included (not reverted, not orphaned) launches inside covered
# windows, without the launches while no source was connected (outage_launches, reported apart).
# Actionable before the block: Flap full_before; Four Classic classic_actionable; OpenFour
# openfour_actionable (full transaction before the block time and the token derived from its bytes;
# a Classic token that is only a candidate of the frozen pairs is not actionable).
# Reported without a threshold: launches per day, hash-only/after/missed shares (missed = never
# visible to a free source: the PRIVATE/UNKNOWN limit), the later-sighting spread across sources,
# launch blocks with external BUYs (contested), the Strategy C filter pass share and the Phase I
# placement of its entries against foreign BUYs.
BSC_G04_CRITERIA_STATE=PROPOSED
# Duration: seven calendar days from the campaign start, never extended.
BSC_G04_CAMPAIGN_DAYS=7
# Valid only with at least this share of the campaign covered by a running capture (ppm), no INVALID
# journal and clock_suspect=false; otherwise NOT_EVALUABLE.
BSC_G04_MIN_COVERED_PPM=800000
# Minimum denominator per venue; below it that venue is NOT_EVALUABLE (its launch rate is the result).
BSC_G04_MIN_LAUNCHES_FLAP=1000
BSC_G04_MIN_LAUNCHES_CLASSIC=1000
BSC_G04_MIN_LAUNCHES_OPENFOUR=100
# Per venue: CONTINUE (WEITER) when the actionable share reaches this (ppm) and the median lead of the
# actionable sightings before the block time reaches this (µs).
BSC_G04_CONTINUE_ACTIONABLE_PPM=300000
BSC_G04_CONTINUE_LEAD_P50_US=100000
# Per venue: STOP (STOPP) for the free-source pre-block path below this actionable share (ppm);
# between STOP and CONTINUE: ADAPT (UMSTEUERN). A free-source STOP is no verdict on the native geth
# path (Mainnet geth cost decision) and no venue STOP under plan §21.
BSC_G04_STOP_ACTIONABLE_PPM=50000
# Overall: CONTINUE if any evaluable venue continues, else ADAPT if any adapts, else STOP.
